WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.936
Private events bring in serious revenue, and they take serious coordination. Meet Events and Catering, from Club Steward.

2
00:00:08.236 --> 00:00:14.272
Your events team starts every morning with one screen. What's booked, what's owed, and what needs attention today.

3
00:00:16.172 --> 00:00:24.183
A new inquiry becomes an event in one step, and the room is held with setup and teardown built in. Double bookings get caught before they happen.

4
00:00:25.822 --> 00:00:34.528
Hosts can even plan on their own, online. They pick a room, choose the food and drinks, and get a price the moment they finish, straight from the club's real menu.

5
00:00:36.428 --> 00:00:42.764
One menu serves the whole club. Update a dish once, and the restaurant, every event, and every package stay in sync.

6
00:00:44.664 --> 00:00:52.317
Hosts plan in their own portal. Menu choices, the guest list, the seating chart, and payments, with far fewer back-and-forth emails.

7
00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:58.687
The kitchen's prep list and supplier orders build themselves, from every booked event.

8
00:01:00.587 --> 00:01:04.691
Staffing comes straight from each event, and your team picks up shifts from their phones.

9
00:01:06.591 --> 00:01:13.245
Florists, bands, and outside caterers see only their part of the event, and their insurance is checked before they arrive.

10
00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:22.135
On the night, your banquet captain runs the event from a phone. What's happening now, what's next, and every allergy, table by table.

11
00:01:23.435 --> 00:01:29.032
Afterwards, the final bill goes straight to the member's house account, and you see exactly what every event made.

12
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:35.533
Events and Catering, part of Club Steward, by Ardn. Every event, start to finish.
